Two of the skill documents in this repository (`git-release-hygiene` and
`github-repository-presentation`) began as documents contributed to the
`dsh-agent-team-presets` project (MIT, https://github.com/bloodarea/dsh-agent-team-presets).
The versions here include later revisions made in that project and local edits by
this repository's owner.

`skills/skill-creator/` is adapted from Anthropic's skill-creator, distributed under
the Apache License 2.0. The original license text ships unmodified as
`skills/skill-creator/LICENSE.txt`. The adaptation rewrites the guidance for DeepSeek
Harness (skill discovery, single-file format, invocation frontmatter), drops the
bundled `.skill` packaging step that DSH does not have, and replaces the
PyYAML-dependent validator with a zero-dependency one.

`paper-figure-audit` is original to this repository.

